# The tutorial's ending: a will's search across the world map, re-shot on its own from city.cli's last
# checkpoint (build/rec_city3/saves/02_routines.json, copied to the --save-path before the take): the world
# map just outside the city, boots on and the purse empty. Diligence wants work; the ◎ beside the ☰ opens
# the party's wills, and pressing "find work" reads every place within reach, nearest by road first, and
# plans the trip to the first where the will would be met. Then the closing frame.
#
# FLAGS: as city.cli's.
allow-flag-miss --start-area
allow-flag-miss --observe-only

wait mode MainMenu 900
mark resume_will
click menu Continue
wait mode WorldView 900
cursor rest
hold 4

# ── The will search ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
mark will_search
clip will_picker
click will-button
wait for 0.3
cursor rest
hold 12
click will diligence
wait for 0.3
cursor rest
hold 16
clip end will_picker
clip will_search
click want 0
wait 300
cursor rest
hold 42
clip end will_search

# ── Closure ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
mark closure
clip closure
cursor hide
hold 14
clip end closure
state
quit
